{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 1, "text": "戒指"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 2, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 3, "text": "// Answer 1 (Where have you been all this time?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 4, "text": "我一直在寻找让你进入核心的方法。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 5, "text": "安然无恙，还能全身而退，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 6, "text": "这是我们一直以来的计划，对吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 7, "text": "为此我也必须避开"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 8, "text": "疯狂米塔，对吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 9, "text": "同时挖掘一切有用的信息"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 10, "text": "关于这该死的宇宙后端的信息，对吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 11, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 12, "text": "嗯…可能是吧…？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 13, "text": "不过你是怎么在戒指上设置的路线？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 14, "text": "怎么就把我送到一个"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 15, "text": "到处是bug的危险版本里去了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 16, "text": "我还是跳进了无尽的黑暗中"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 17, "text": "才逃出生天的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 19, "text": "对不起，我忘了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 20, "text": "我忘了告诉你具体应该怎么做…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 21, "text": "但计划就是这样！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 22, "text": "你要跳脱出这一切…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 23, "text": "在我看来，你确实做到了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 24, "text": "真是太厉害了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 25, "text": "现在我们可以执行计划了，明白了吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 27, "text": "// Answer 2 (How did you get here?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 28, "text": "你一定经历了许多，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 29, "text": "才会忘记我们谈话的细节。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 30, "text": "我是米塔，我可以在不同版本之间穿梭，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 31, "text": "毫无阻碍，记得吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 32, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 33, "text": "并不是所有的米塔都能做到这一点，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 34, "text": "我已经见识过了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 35, "text": "而且她们显然很痛苦…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 37, "text": "别说了。她们的版本有问题，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 38, "text": "那些世界是有bug的，我告诉过你。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 39, "text": "该死的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 40, "text": "你知道是谁搞的鬼吧..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 41, "text": "疯狂米塔。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 43, "text": "没错，绝对是她…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 44, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 45, "text": "// Answer 3 (Who was this Mita just now?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 46, "text": "是丑陋米塔。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 47, "text": "又蠢又坏。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 48, "text": "你跟她没道理可讲，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 49, "text": "她的世界里只有疯狂米塔。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 51, "text": "是的，我也发现了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 53, "text": "来吧，我们得去核心了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 54, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 55, "text": "// Answer 4 (How does the ring work?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 56, "text": "还有这枚戒指，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 57, "text": "只能通过这种方式找到核心吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 58, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 59, "text": "是的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 60, "text": "如果我们能组装一个传送门，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 61, "text": "就能立刻，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 62, "text": "把你传送到这里了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 63, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 64, "text": "那这戒指还有什么好处？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 65, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 66, "text": "当然有！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 67, "text": "戴起来很方便。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 68, "text": "它还能记下"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 69, "text": "所有那些你曾去过的版本。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 70, "text": "你还可以再次进入它们。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 72, "text": "// Answer 5 (Why does Mad Mita need me?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 73, "text": "为什么疯狂米塔不肯放过我？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 74, "text": "她把我拉进她的危险游戏里，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 75, "text": "但还留着我的性命…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 77, "text": "我觉得，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 78, "text": "她想找到一个合适的玩家…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 79, "text": "一个能接受她本来的样子的玩家。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 80, "text": "毕竟，米塔就是米塔！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 81, "text": "虽然这显然不太可能，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 82, "text": "所以她才把玩家都做成卡带，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 83, "text": "这样就没人能逃出她的手掌心了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 84, "text": "我猜应该就是这样…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 85, "text": "言归正传。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 87, "text": "// Answer 6 (Is this the core?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 88, "text": "就是这里吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 89, "text": "核心？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 90, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 91, "text": "核心。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 92, "text": "我之前有跟你解释过…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 93, "text": "玩家不属于这个世界…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 94, "text": "所以他们在这里不需要特别许可。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 95, "text": "这是，嗯…只是我的猜测。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 96, "text": "但我敢肯定，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 97, "text": "在这个房间里，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 98, "text": "就藏着我们所有问题的答案！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 99, "text": "[player]，进去看看吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 100, "text": "我已经试过了，我是真的不行…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 102, "text": "// Look on CoreMita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 103, "text": "小心点，[player]."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 104, "text": "它在监视你。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 105, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 106, "text": "它是谁？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 107, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 108, "text": "我也不太清楚…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 109, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 110, "text": "挺酷的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 111, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 112, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 113, "text": "这是什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 114, "text": "嘿！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 115, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 116, "text": "我找到了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 118, "text": "太棒了！好极了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 119, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 120, "text": "但是它需要指定版本。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 121, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 122, "text": "对，我记得她的版本是…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 123, "text": "00.98"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 124, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 125, "text": "没错！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 126, "text": "好，编号是多少？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 127, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 128, "text": "编号？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 129, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 130, "text": "它需要指定一个编号，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 131, "text": "你不会不知道吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 132, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 133, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 134, "text": "等一下，这样说也对，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 135, "text": "每个米塔都有自己的编号，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 136, "text": "你不能就这样重启全部版本…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 137, "text": "那太乱来了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 138, "text": "我居然忘了这回事…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 139, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 141, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 142, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 143, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 144, "text": "// Answer 1 (What's wrong with you?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 145, "text": "我什么都好，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 146, "text": "如果不考虑眼前的麻烦事的话。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 147, "text": "一切都还好，只是发生了许多变化…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 148, "text": "得好好想想…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 149, "text": "就这样吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 150, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 151, "text": "// Answer 2 (Maybe there's a way to get to know him?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 152, "text": "我…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 153, "text": "我觉得…这怎么可能啊！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 154, "text": "简直就是疯了，哈！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 155, "text": "这就像大海捞针一样…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 156, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 157, "text": "你在做什么呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 159, "text": "有故障的地方有时会暴露出信息，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 160, "text": "就像这个世界的内脏被掏出来了一样！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 161, "text": "日志，日志，日志，数据？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 162, "text": "如果真是这样呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 163, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 164, "text": "啊？怎么了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 165, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 166, "text": "我想起一个地方！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 167, "text": "你在这里等我。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 168, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 169, "text": "你要去哪里？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 170, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 171, "text": "// Answer 3 (What if we attack Mad Mita?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 172, "text": "你说过，任何米塔…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 173, "text": "在死亡后都会重新启动…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 174, "text": "如果我们…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 175, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 176, "text": "如果我们杀了疯狂米塔呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 177, "text": "你是认真的吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 178, "text": "你要怎么对抗一个拿着电锯的女孩？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 179, "text": "而且她的刀可不止是切胡萝卜用的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 180, "text": "而且不知道为什么，她的力气也大得吓人！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 181, "text": "我们还活着就已经是奇迹了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 182, "text": "来吧，我们得去核心了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 183, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 184, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 185, "text": "// core console entry"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 186, "text": "我需要输入口令"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 187, "text": "但口令是什么呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 188, "text": "米塔，你知道吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 189, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 190, "text": "也许有记录在什么地方？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 191, "text": "你能找找吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 192, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 193, "text": "// core console - nope programm"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 194, "text": "可能不是这个"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 195, "text": "还是不对"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 196, "text": "不对"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 197, "text": "这个也不是"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 198, "text": "我必须找到重新启动角色的选项"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 199, "text": "// core console - nope version"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 200, "text": "版本不对。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 201, "text": "哎呀，搞错了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 202, "text": "不是这个。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 203, "text": "需要再改改。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 204, "text": "// core console - nope index"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 205, "text": "有点不对劲"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 206, "text": "编号有误"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 207, "text": "我需要重新输入编号"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 208, "text": "编号不匹配"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 209, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 210, "text": "// Answer 4 (Little people - Chibi)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 211, "text": "你知道吗，我在路上碰到过，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 212, "text": "一群小人…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 213, "text": "他们是谁？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 214, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 215, "text": "袖珍角色吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 216, "text": "不知道怎么解释…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 217, "text": "这是我们这个世界的一种现象，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 218, "text": "每个米塔都有袖珍米塔的形态。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 219, "text": "不过玩家也有这个形态…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 220, "text": "米塔可以召唤她们，你知道吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 221, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 222, "text": "怎么做到的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 223, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 224, "text": "就像现在，你看！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 225, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 226, "text": "简直就像魔法…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 227, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 228, "text": "但我的袖珍米塔总是会出问题，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 229, "text": "她们大部分从诞生时就夭折了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 230, "text": "不过，还有一个好一些。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 231, "text": "我也说不上…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 232, "text": "她只会兜着转圈…"}
